cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "INQUIRE_TIP – Toxicity-Informed Prioritization"
abstract: >-
  Python/JupyterLab pipeline for toxicity-driven prioritization of chemical features detected by
  non-target screening, combining Elastic Net, stability selection, XGBoost, SHAP and the
  Final Stability-Adjusted Compound Index (FSACI) per toxicity endpoint.
type: software
authors:
